title Vinyl now playing, 800x480 (draft NowPlaying-800x480, NP-800x480 of P2a): the queue pane and now playing; the bottom row Browse, Menu (P2a: in the Output key's place) and the volume group
sizes 800x480
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot now-playing
expect esc
expect text "QUEUE, 20 TRACKS"
expect text "Amerie, 1 Thing (Siik Remix)"
expect text "Menu"
expect notext "Output"
expect notext "Equalizer"
expect notext "Vol 60"
expect text "60"
expect noquit
